evelopment are similar in these two species and also to P. californicus.","author_count":2,"author_ids":["A5010741268","A5017430273"],"author_institution_ids":["I26347476"],"authors":[{"id":"A5010741268","name":"Leonard R. Brand"},{"id":"A5017430273","name":"Raymond E. Ryckman"}],"ca_any_author":true,"ca_led":true,"cited_by_count":19,"doi":"https://doi.org/10.2307/1378208","domain_tags":[],"facet_tags":[],"institution_ids":["I26347476"],"is_oa":false,"journal":"Journal of Mammalogy","last_updated":"2026-11-07T11:25:07.637180","license":"","needs_review":false,"oa_status":"closed","oa_url":"https://doi.org/10.2307/1378208","openalex_topics":["T10174","T11354","T11913"],"plastic_related":false,"plastic_tier":"","primary_topic":"T10174","pub_date":"1968-08-01","study_type":"article","title":"Laboratory Life Histories of Peromyscus eremicus and Peromyscus interparietalis","type":"article","work_id":"W4302402779","year":1968}]}
